    map of modules to a map of chain complexes
  * *note extend(Complex,Complex,Matrix,Sequence):
    (Complexes)extend_lpComplex_cmComplex_cmMatrix_cmSequence_rp, -- extend a
    map of modules to a map of chain complexes
  * *note extend(Permutation,Permutation):
    extend_lpPermutation_cmPermutation_rp, -- rewrites two permutations to be
    permutations on the same number of symbols

