  * Inputs:
      * w, a *note permutation: Permutation,, 
  * Outputs:
      * a *note Boolean value: (Macaulay2Doc)Boolean,, 

Description
===========

A permutation $p$ is Cartwright-Sturmfels if it avoids all of the following
patterns: $12543$, $13254$, $13524$, $13542$, $21543$, $125364$, $125634$,
$215364$, $215634$, $315264$, $315624$, and $315642$.

