File: Permutations.info, Node: Permutation == Permutation, Next: Permutation ^ ZZ, Prev: Permutation _st VisibleList, Up: Top

Permutation == Permutation -- whether two permutations are the same
*******************************************************************

  * Operator: *note ==: (Macaulay2Doc)==,
  * Usage: 
        w == v
  * Inputs:
      * w, a *note permutation: Permutation,, 
      * v, a *note permutation: Permutation,, 
  * Outputs:
      * a *note Boolean value: (Macaulay2Doc)Boolean,, 

Description
===========

Two permutations $p$ and $q$ are equal if $p(i) = q(i)$ for all $i$.

+-------------------------------------+
|i1 : p = permutation {3,1,2,5,4}     |
|                                     |
|o1 = Permutation{3, 1, 2, 5, 4}      |
|                                     |
|o1 : Permutation                     |
+-------------------------------------+
|i2 : q = permutation {3,1,2,5,4,6,7} |
|                                     |
|o2 = Permutation{3, 1, 2, 5, 4, 6, 7}|
|                                     |
|o2 : Permutation                     |
+-------------------------------------+
|i3 : p == q                          |
|                                     |
|o3 = true                            |
+-------------------------------------+

The permutations do not need to be the same length.

+----------------------------------+
|i4 : p = permutation {3,1,2,4}    |
|                                  |
|o4 = Permutation{3, 1, 2, 4}      |
|                                  |
|o4 : Permutation                  |
+----------------------------------+
|i5 : q = permutation {3,1,2,4,5,6}|
|                                  |
|o5 = Permutation{3, 1, 2, 4, 5, 6}|
|                                  |
|o5 : Permutation                  |
+----------------------------------+
|i6 : p == q                       |
|                                  |
|o6 = true                         |
+----------------------------------+

Ways to use this method:
========================

  * *note Permutation == Permutation: Permutation == Permutation, -- whether
    two permutations are the same
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

