Permutation _ List -- selects a subset of the permutation when regarded as a list
*********************************************************************************

  * Operator: *note _: (Macaulay2Doc)_us,
  * Usage: 
        w_l
  * Inputs:
      * w, a *note permutation: Permutation,, 
      * l, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, 
  * Outputs:
      * a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, 

Description
===========

Selects a subset of the permutation when it is regarded as a list. It is
important to note that the output may not be a valid permutation.

The indices should be 0-indexed.

+--------------------------------+
|i1 : p = permutation {3,1,2,5,4}|
|                                |
|o1 = Permutation{3, 1, 2, 5, 4} |
|                                |
|o1 : Permutation                |
+--------------------------------+
|i2 : p_{1,2}                    |
|                                |
|o2 = {1, 2}                     |
|                                |
|o2 : List                       |
+--------------------------------+

