      * n, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, 
  * Outputs:
      * an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, 

Description
===========

Selects an element from the permutation when it is regarded as a list. The
index should be 1-indexed.

