records -- computes the saliances of a permutation
**************************************************

  * Usage: 
        records w
  * Inputs:
      * w, a *note permutation: Permutation,, 
  * Outputs:
      * a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, 

Description
===========

A permutation $p$ has a record at $i$ if $p(j) < p(i)$ for all $j < i$.

