    generators and relations
  * "trim(MonomialIdeal)" -- see *note trim: (Macaulay2Doc)trim, -- minimize
    generators and relations
  * "trim(Permutation)"
  * "trim(QuotientRing)" -- see *note trim: (Macaulay2Doc)trim, -- minimize
    generators and relations
